<!-- Generated from ~/Desktop/KANT/xSting/model/xSting_51.step by scripts/build_urdf_linear.py + hand edits of xSting_roll_v44.urdf, then scripts/make_xsting_48.py (OpenCR / LiPo / FL1 brackets moved, LDS-03 removed) and scripts/make_xsting_51.py (wheelbase 200 mm, OpenCR / LiPo / FL1 brackets / 2nd-deck pillars moved, 150 mm turntable disc, arm moved on the disc). Masses: datasheet values (XM430, OpenCR, LB-012, D435, TB3 Waffle Pi / OpenMANIPULATOR-X totals) where available, density estimates otherwise; joint limits are placeholders. -->
<!-- Axis convention: every movable joint uses axis="0 0 1" (joint frame +z = physical axis). -->
<!-- Merged into xsting_description from xsting_51 (2026-10-28): geometry, masses and meshes from xSting_51.urdf;
     kept from the previous mk1 model: arm / gripper / wheel limits used by ros2_control, and the ros2_control blocks.
     The wrist camera frames are renamed gripper_camera_* so that camera_link is free for the RealSense driver. -->
